267→<h1>Another World on KN5000</h1>
268→<p class="subtitle">
269→  A port of Eric Chahi's Another World bytecode VM to the Technics KN5000 arranger keyboard.<br>
270→  Made possible by the ongoing reverse engineering efforts documented at
271→  <a href="http://arqueologiadigital.org/KN5000-docs/">arqueologiadigital.org/KN5000-docs</a>.<br>
272→  <a href="https://github.com/felipesanches/kn5000-anotherworld">github.com/felipesanches/kn5000-anotherworld</a>
273→</p>
274→
