295→<h2>Hardware</h2>
296→<dl class="specs">
297→  <dt>Target CPU</dt>    <dd>TMP94C241F (TLCS-900/H2) @ 16 MHz</dd>
298→  <dt>Display</dt>        <dd>MN89304 VGA LCD controller, 320x240 @ 8bpp</dd>
299→  <dt>Assembler</dt>      <dd>ASL Macro Assembler (<code>cpu 96c141</code>)</dd>
300→  <dt>VM origin</dt>      <dd>Big-endian Amiga/68k bytecode on little-endian TLCS-900</dd>
301→  <dt>Status</dt>         <dd>Intro plays fully: polygons, palette, text, timer-based frame pacing</dd>
302→</dl>
